  "longBusinessSummary": "Southern Petrochemical Industries Corporation Limited engages in the manufacture and sale of fertilizers in India and internationally. It offers primary nutrients, secondary nutrients, micronutrients, water soluble fertilizers, organic fertilizers, non-edible de-oiled cake fertilizers, bio fertilizers, organic pesticides, plant growth regulators, plant biostimulants, liquid fertilizer, nano fertilizer, and beneficial element fertilizers; and industrial products, including gypsum, aluminum fluoride, ammonium chloride, and silica. The company also engages in the tissue culture business. In addition, it provides agricultural services, such as soil management, farmer training centers, journal, agri clinic, and SMS services for farmers, as well as agro biotech centers. Southern Petrochemical Industries Corporation Limited was incorporated in 1969 and is headquartered in Chennai, India.",
